flowchart TD
  R[HTTP request] --> SF[Spring Security filter chain<br/>login, role check, CSRF, session]
  SF --> DS[Spring DispatcherServlet]
  DS --> C[Controllers<br/>Login, Position, Language, Candidate, Marks]
  C --> SV[Services]
  SV --> D[DAOs with SQL<br/>NamedParameterJdbcTemplate]
  D --> J[JNDI DataSource] --> DB[(MySQL)]
  C --> V[JSP views + shared layout] --> H[HTML to the browser]
